{"id":"certainement","lemma":"certainement","pos":"adv","rank":860,"glosses":["certainly (with certainty, without doubt)","probably (very likely, although not entirely sure)"],"ipa":"/sɛʁ.tɛn.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bf/Fr-certainement.ogg/Fr-certainement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Vous avez certainement beaucoup de questions.","en":"You certainly have a lot of questions.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"question","l":"question"}]},{"text":"Vous pouvez certainement compter sur lui.","en":"You can certainly rely on him.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},null,{"g":"to count"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"him, he, it"}]},{"text":"Il est certainement intelligent.","en":"He certainly is smart.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"intelligent"}]},{"text":"C'est certainement possible.","en":"That's certainly possible.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Je ne suis certainement pas ton ami.","en":"I'm certainly not your friend.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"friend"}]}]}